  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電磁學(二)",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTROMAGNETICS(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程首先在靜磁條件下，推導靜磁場的散度(微分形式磁場的高斯定律)與旋度(微分形式磁場的安培定律)相關定律，並介紹其應用於向量磁位、磁性材料及電感等。之後改為動態條件下，引入法拉第感應定律及位移電流修的正安培定律，以形成完整的微分形式馬克思威爾方程式，並應於電磁邊界條件與電磁波動方程式的推導。最後在時間諧振場的假設下，介紹電磁波動方程式的均勻平面電磁波解，並探討其在均勻介質的傳播特性，以及在異質邊界的反射與穿透。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will study, under the magnetostatic condition, the laws about the divergence (Gauss’s law of magnetic field) and curl of static magnetic field (Ampere’s law), and its applications on vector magnetic potential, magnetic materials, and inductors. Next, under dynamic condition, we will introduce and discuss the Faraday’s law and the displacement-current modified Ampere’s law to complete the study of the differential form of Maxwell’s equations. Based on the differential form of Maxwell’s equations, we will derive the boundary conditions of electromagnetics and the wave equation of electromagnetics. Under time-harmonic field condition, we discuss the uniform plane wave solution. Finally, students will learn the behavior of uniform plane wave propagating through a uniform material and the reflection and transmission on the boundary between two materials.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "MATH1005微積分(一)、MATH1006微積分(二)、PHYS2001電磁學(一)、PHYS1003普通物理(一)、PHYS1004普通物理(二)、ENGS2011工程數學(一)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "MATH1005",
    "pre_sub_ename": "MATH1005 CALCULUS(1)、MATH1006 CALCULUS(2)、PHYS2001 ELECTROMAGNETICS(1)、PHYS1003 GENERAL PHYSICS(1)、PHYS1004 GENERAL PHYSICS(2)、ENGS2011 ENGINEERING MATHEMATICS(1)",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "熟悉靜磁學和Maxwell方程式的微分及積分形式。",
      "describe_en": "Be familiar with the static magnetism and the differential and integral form of Maxwell's equations."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解電磁技術和最新應用。",
      "describe_en": "To underdtand the technology of electromagnetics."
    }
  ],
